tapint\u00e1s\u00fa. Ha a kellemetlen szag hamar visszat\u00e9r, \u00e9rdemes lehet kevesebb illatos term\u00e9ket haszn\u00e1lni, alaposabban adagolni, vagy id\u0151nk\u00e9nt illatmentes mos\u00f3szerrel tesztelni, t\u00e9nyleg j\u00f3l mos-e a g\u00e9p.<\/p>","type":"sliderimage","tag":"","sizes":[{"key":"y","width":1800,"height":1200,"filesize":640659,"url":"https:\/\/galeria.cdn.velvet.hu\/checkout\/2026\/06\/11\/7_regi_mosasi_szabaly_amit_jobb_lenne_elfelejteni\/69886075_76d285c899ee9858ee0b839849a8bd09_y.jpg","storeurl":"https:\/\/kep.cdn.indexvas.hu\/1\/0\/6988\/69886\/698860\/69886075_76d285c899ee9858ee0b839849a8bd09_y.jpg"},{"key":"x","width":1300,"height":867,"filesize":365836,"url":"https:\/\/galeria.cdn.velvet.hu\/checkout\/2026\/06\/11\/7_regi_mosasi_szabaly_amit_jobb_lenne_elfelejteni\/69886075_76d285c899ee9858ee0b839849a8bd09_x.jpg","storeurl":"https:\/\/kep.cdn.indexvas.hu\/1\/0\/6988\/69886\/698860\/69886075_76d285c899ee9858ee0b839849a8bd09_x.jpg"},{"key":"m","width":1000,"height":667,"filesize":233222,"url":"https:\/\/galeria.cdn.velvet.hu\/checkout\/2026\/06\/11\/7_regi_mosasi_szabaly_amit_jobb_lenne_elfelejteni\/69886075_76d285c899ee9858ee0b839849a8bd09_m.jpg","storeurl":"https:\/\/kep.cdn.indexvas.hu\/1\/0\/6988\/69886\/698860\/69886075_76d285c899ee9858ee0b839849a8bd09_m.jpg"},{"key":"j","width":840,"height":560,"filesize":172543,"url":"https:\/\/galeria.cdn.velvet.hu\/checkout\/2026\/06\/11\/7_regi_mosasi_szabaly_amit_jobb_lenne_elfelejteni\/69886075_76d285c899ee9858ee0b839849a8bd09_j.jpg","storeurl":"https:\/\/kep.cdn.indexvas.hu\/1\/0\/6988\/69886\/698860\/69886075_76d285c899ee9858ee0b839849a8bd09_j.jpg"},{"key":"l","width":760,"height":507,"filesize":146185,"url":"https:\/\/galeria.cdn.velvet.hu\/checkout\/2026\/06\/11\/7_regi_mosasi_szabaly_amit_jobb_lenne_elfelejteni\/69886075_76d285c899ee9858ee0b839849a8bd09_l.jpg","storeurl":"https:\/\/kep.cdn.indexvas.hu\/1\/0\/6988\/69886\/698860\/69886075_76d285c899ee9858ee0b839849a8bd09_l.jpg"},{"ke