gyakorlatilag mindig azt haszn\u00e1lj\u00e1k. Pedig egy\u00e1ltal\u00e1n nem mindegy, hogy t\u00f6r\u00f6lk\u00f6z\u0151t, \u00e1gynem\u0171t, farmert, selyembl\u00fazt vagy \u00e9ppen sportruh\u00e1zatot mosunk a g\u00e9pben. A programok nem csak brahib\u00f3l vannak, ha pedig minden ruh\u00e1t ugyan\u00fagy kezel\u00fcnk, akkor azt is kock\u00e1ztatjuk, hogy hamarabb t\u00f6nkremennek. Egy perc be\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1s sokszor \u00e9vekkel hosszabb\u00edthatja meg egy kedvenc darab \u00e9let\u00e9t.<\/p>","type":"sliderimage","tag":"","sizes":[{"key":"y","width":1800,"height":1200,"filesize":480281,"url":"https:\/\/galeria.cdn.velvet.hu\/checkout\/2026\/06\/11\/7_regi_mosasi_szabaly_amit_jobb_lenne_elfelejteni\/69886077_724c57dcb947bf67f345501d340dbfea_y.jpg","storeurl":"https:\/\/kep.cdn.indexvas.hu\/1\/0\/6988\/69886\/698860\/69886077_724c57dcb947bf67f345501d340dbfea_y.jpg"},{"key":"x","width":1300,"height":867,"filesize":279216,"url":"https:\/\/galeria.cdn.velvet.hu\/checkout\/2026\/06\/11\/7_regi_mosasi_szabaly_amit_jobb_lenne_elfelejteni\/69886077_724c57dcb947bf67f345501d340dbfea_x.jpg","storeurl":"https:\/\/kep.cdn.indexvas.hu\/1\/0\/6988\/69886\/698860\/69886077_724c57dcb947bf67f345501d340dbfea_x.jpg"},{"key":"m","width":1000,"height":667,"filesize":181212,"url":"https:\/\/galeria.cdn.velvet.hu\/checkout\/2026\/06\/11\/7_regi_mosasi_szabaly_amit_jobb_lenne_elfelejteni\/69886077_724c57dcb947bf67f345501d340dbfea_m.jpg","storeurl":"https:\/\/kep.cdn.indexvas.hu\/1\/0\/6988\/69886\/698860\/69886077_724c57dcb947bf67f345501d340dbfea_m.jpg"},{"key":"j","width":840,"height":560,"filesize":135276,"url":"https:\/\/galeria.cdn.velvet.hu\/checkout\/2026\/06\/11\/7_regi_mosasi_szabaly_amit_jobb_lenne_elfelejteni\/69886077_724c57dcb947bf67f345501d340dbfea_j.jpg","storeurl":"https:\/\/kep.cdn.indexvas.hu\/1\/0\/6988\/69886\/698860\/69886077_724c57dcb947bf67f345501d340dbfea_j.jpg"},{"key":"l","width":760,"height":507,"filesize":115919,"url":"https:\/\/galeria.cdn.velvet.h