ndscape":true},{"id":"69886079","align":"right","info":"Kathrin Ziegler \/ Getty Images Hungary","text":"<h3>A c\u00edmke csak d\u00edsz<\/h3>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>A ruhac\u00edmk\u00e9k nem v\u00e9letlen\u00fcl vannak ott, m\u00e9g ha sokszor ideges\u00edt\u0151en sz\u00farnak is. Ezek mutatj\u00e1k meg, milyen anyagb\u00f3l k\u00e9sz\u00fclt a ruha, moshat\u00f3-e g\u00e9pben, b\u00edrja-e a sz\u00e1r\u00edt\u00f3g\u00e9pet, vagy ink\u00e1bb k\u00e9zi mos\u00e1st ig\u00e9nyel.<\/p>\n<p>Egy rossz h\u0151fok, t\u00fal er\u0151s centrifuga vagy sz\u00e1r\u00edt\u00f3g\u00e9p k\u00f6nnyen t\u00f6nkretehet egy ruh\u00e1t. A zsugorod\u00e1s, a bolyhosod\u00e1s, a sz\u00ednfog\u00e1s vagy a deform\u00e1l\u00f3d\u00e1s nagy r\u00e9sze megel\u0151zhet\u0151 lenne, ha mos\u00e1s el\u0151tt nem csak automatikusan bedob\u00e1ln\u00e1nk mindent.<\/p>","type":"sliderimage","tag":"","sizes":[{"key":"y","width":1800,"height":1277,"filesize":713723,"url":"https:\/\/galeria.cdn.velvet.hu\/checkout\/2026\/06\/11\/7_regi_mosasi_szabaly_amit_jobb_lenne_elfelejteni\/69886079_1345224cbdc2c4a70edb5e07b97cdd24_y.jpg","storeurl":"https:\/\/kep.cdn.indexvas.hu\/1\/0\/6988\/69886\/698860\/69886079_1345224cbdc2c4a70edb5e07b97cdd24_y.jpg"},{"key":"x","width":1300,"height":922,"filesize":386106,"url":"https:\/\/galeria.cdn.velvet.hu\/checkout\/2026\/06\/11\/7_regi_mosasi_szabaly_amit_jobb_lenne_elfelejteni\/69886079_1345224cbdc2c4a70edb5e07b97cdd24_x.jpg","storeurl":"https:\/\/kep.cdn.indexvas.hu\/1\/0\/6988\/69886\/698860\/69886079_1345224cbdc2c4a70edb5e07b97cdd24_x.jpg"},{"key":"m","width":1000,"height":710,"filesize":242924,"url":"https:\/\/galeria.cdn.velvet.hu\/checkout\/2026\/06\/11\/7_regi_mosasi_szabaly_amit_jobb_lenne_elfelejteni\/69886079_1345224cbdc2c4a70edb5e07b97cdd24_m.jpg","storeurl":"https:\/\/kep.cdn.indexvas.hu\/1\/0\/6988\/69886\/698860\/69886079_1345224cbdc2c4a70edb5e07b97cdd24_m.jpg"},{"key":"j","width":840,"height":596,"filesize":181282,"url":"https:\/\/galeria.cdn.velvet.h